	And the user with the email address "osb.customer3@lrcustomer.com.broken" should have the "osb_customer" tag
	When I remove a user the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a customer from the project with the code "ZENOSBE"
	Then the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be in the organization "Zen OSB Automotive"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be in the organization "Zen OSB Engineering"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Zen OSB Automotive"
