Scenario: View user tags after multiple role updates
	Zendesk users that are part of mulitple OSB projects should be updated accordingly when their OSB roles are updated.

	Given I update a customer on the project with the code "ZENOSBA" with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to the role of "Watcher"
	Then the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Zen OSB Automotive"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Zen OSB Engineering"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Zen OSB Automotive"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer3@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Zen OSB Engineering"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be subscribed to the organization "Zen OSB Automotive"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be subscribed to the organization "Zen OSB Engineering"
